      en: ["George Town was inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2008.", "Fort Cornwallis is the largest British-built fort remaining in Malaysia.", "The Cheong Fatt Tze Blue Mansion is a world-renowned example of 19th-century architecture.", "George Town is widely regarded as the culinary capital of Malaysia.", "The Kek Lok Si Temple is one of the largest Buddhist temple complexes in Southeast Asia.", "The city was the first settlement established by the British East India Company in Malaya."],
