      en: ["Founded in 1995 to serve as Malaysia's administrative center.", "The Putrajaya Lake covers an area of 600 hectares.", "The Putra Mosque can accommodate up to 15,000 worshippers.", "Became the seat of the federal government in 1999.", "Named after Tunku Abdul Rahman Putra, the first Prime Minister.", "The Seri Wawasan Bridge is a landmark of modern design."],
