      en: ["Officially granted city status in October 2020.", "Development began in 1976 on a former rubber estate.", "Home to Sunway Pyramid, a major Egyptian-themed shopping mall.", "Renowned as a regional education hub with multiple universities.", "Estimated population exceeds 700,000 residents.", "Strategically located in the Klang Valley near Kuala Lumpur."],
