      en: ["Klang is the official Royal City of the state of Selangor.", "Port Klang is ranked among the top 20 busiest ports in the world.", "Archaeological evidence shows habitation since the Bronze Age.", "Served as the capital of Selangor before Kuala Lumpur.", "Istana Alam Shah is the official residence of the Sultan.", "Famous for its colonial-era historic fire station built in 1890."],
